A||||5||JohnnyK||Important T-top question! Please help!||||1||
Z||000000||JohnnyK||03-15-2001||08:07 PM||||I am picking up a beat to hell 84 Fiero on monday, but the thing is, it has t-tops, so what I want to do is this. Pull the roof off the 84, pull the roof of my 85, and switch them around. Is this feasible? The only problem is, the parents are a little testy with another beat up FIero here, so I can't do it here, which means I would have to do it in a friends garage, so I would only have a day or too. Possible? Also I have to replace the headliner in the t-top, but I assume I should be able to do that quickly?||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroBUZZ||03-15-2001||08:26 PM||||Johnny:  If you don't have time you can whack the top off quickly and store it.  It will be an aftermarket kit if it's an 84 (glass sails, speaker seats, etc?).  You'll have to be confident you don't compromise structural integrity on your install.  Sounds more complicated than it's worth. Just my $ .02.<BR>Gary<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/buzzsig.jpg"> ||||reg||3
Z||000002||Raydar||03-15-2001||11:10 PM||||JohnnyK,<BR>Good luck if you attempt this. It sure isn't anything that I would try to do myself.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR>When you get ready to take the 84 apart, be very careful of the rubber weather strips. The ones that go around the door and T-top opening (starting at the front of the door, across to the T-bar, down the middle, to the back of the roof and back down to the door) are no longer available. Anywhere. <BR>Buy a can of weatherstrip adhesive release agent, and go slowly. <BR>BTW... I'm in the process of replacing my headliner. It's kinda like trying to giftwrap 10 lbs. of Jello. While holding it above your head.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe<p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 03-15-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||skitime||03-15-2001||11:23 PM||||Been there and done that T-top head liner thing. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||JohnnyK||03-16-2001||12:41 AM||||Forget it. If I can't do it in a day, I can't do it at all, cause I have no place to put them (can't even put them in my driveway). So i'd be doing it in a friends driveway or something and can't really leave two roofless cars there overnight.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000005||Phil||03-16-2001||05:57 AM||||Johnny<BR>Seeing that you've decided not to buy the ttop ,why don't you post a contact phone number and location? I'm sure someone here would(not me) would be interested in a $100 CDN ttop||||reg||1
